# Line endings: LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# This repo is developed on both Linux and Windows. Normalizing to LF keeps
# the bash scripts runnable, keeps CI (ubuntu-latest) and local checkouts
# byte-identical, and makes "core.autocrlf" irrelevant: eol=lf overrides it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The one exception: cmd.exe wants CRLF in Windows command scripts.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
